# armour/shared/pauldron_slab5_r: the great SLAB pauldron on the right shoulder (slab.5; FORGE-MANTLE, the envelope: PLAN "The envelope", STYLE_P2 29).
# a flat-topped slab plate with square corners, its lip lit, a lame under its seam (the BROAD mass; the
# envelope's great size).
# 5 px past the 16 px shoulder line facing D (26 across with its pair); the side views the large
# size's width + 1, hanging lower. Rides the lean and the bob and lifts a pixel on wind-ups (`up`).
# Finish regions: R the slab's lip, P the plate, N the seam.
# Shared by the man and the woman (D10). Generated by FORGE-MANTLE gen56.py from shapes56.py (re-run, never
# hand-edit the derived views). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
role pauldron slab.5
layer armNear
anchor shoulderR
keys pauld
z 5
side R

